{
 "_doc": {
  "zh": "由 bun tools/voice/run.ts 生成。疼痛发声合成器的校准目标：公开语料中疼痛发声的声学参数，按强度等级汇总（均值、标准差、分位数、个数）。只有汇总量，没有逐条录音的数值，也没有音频。这是用于教学的疼痛行为计算模型的输入；被模拟的身体没有主观体验。未经专业人员审校。",
  "en": "Generated by bun tools/voice/run.ts. Calibration targets for the pain-vocalisation synthesizer: acoustic parameters of pain vocalisations in published corpora, aggregated per intensity level (mean, SD, quantiles, n). Aggregates only: no per-recording value and no audio. This feeds a computational model of pain behaviour for teaching; the simulated body has no subjective experience. Not reviewed by a specialist."
 },
 "sources": [
  {
   "id": "vivae",
   "citation": "Holz, N., Larrouy-Maestri, P., & Poeppel, D. (2020). The Variably Intense Vocalizations of Affect and Emotion Corpus (VIVAE) [Data set]. Zenodo. Corpus paper: Holz, Larrouy-Maestri & Poeppel (2022), Emotion 22(1), 213–225. Related: Holz, Larrouy-Maestri & Poeppel (2021), The paradoxical role of emotional intensity in the perception of vocal affect, Scientific Reports 11, 9663.",
   "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4066235",
   "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/4066235",
   "licence": "CC BY-NC 4.0 (as stated on the Zenodo record)",
   "use": {
    "zh": "下载后在本机分析其中 185 条疼痛发声（full set），这里只保存按强度等级汇总的统计量。语料本身不在本仓库里，也没有用它训练任何生成模型。",
    "en": "Downloaded and analysed locally (the 185 pain vocalisations of the full set); only per-level aggregate statistics are kept here. The corpus itself is not in this repository and no generative model was trained on it."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "raine2019",
   "citation": "Raine, J., Pisanski, K., Simner, J., & Reby, D. (2019). Vocal communication of simulated pain. Bioacoustics, 28(5), 404–426.",
   "doi": "10.1080/09524622.2018.1463295",
   "url": "https://sussex.figshare.com/articles/journal_contribution/Vocal_communication_of_simulated_pain/23456756",
   "licence": "Accepted manuscript on the University of Sussex repository, marked \"Copyright not evaluated\". Only numbers reported in the paper are quoted here; its recordings were not obtained.",
   "use": {
    "zh": "引用论文表 3、表 4 和正文里报告的各级均值；合成器用其中的男女差来从女声映射推出男声，用各级平均时长来设定持续性疼痛的时长。",
    "en": "Per-level means as reported in Tables 3 and 4 and in the text; the synthesizer uses the male–female differences to derive the male voice from the female mapping and the mean durations for sustained pain."
   }
  }
 ],
 "method": {
  "zh": "分析代码在 tools/voice/analysis.ts，对语料录音和合成输出完全相同：40 毫秒汉宁窗、10 毫秒帧移；自相关法求基频（搜索范围和各门限见 analysisOptions），五点中值平滑，没有人工校正。时长 = 首末活动帧的间隔；电平 = 活动帧的均方根，dB 相对满刻度（语料文件之间保留了相对响度，但没有声压级标定）；谐噪比 = 有声帧上 10·log10(r/(1−r)) 的平均；频谱质心 = 0–10 kHz 幅度谱质心在活动帧上的平均；非线性现象用替代指标：次谐波帧（所选周期的一半或三分之一处有接近的自相关峰）加上发声段内部的非周期帧，占活动帧的比例。这个替代指标不等于 Raine 等人看语谱图手工标注的 %NLP，两者不能直接比。基频跟踪会把一部分气声在共振峰上的窄带鸣响误判成很高的基频，语料和合成两边都受影响。",
  "en": "The analysis code is tools/voice/analysis.ts and is identical for corpus recordings and synthesizer output: 40 ms Hann frames every 10 ms; autocorrelation pitch (search range and thresholds in analysisOptions) with five-point median smoothing and no manual correction. Duration = span from first to last active frame; level = RMS over active frames in dB re full scale (relative loudness is preserved across the corpus files, but there is no sound-pressure calibration); HNR = mean of 10·log10(r/(1−r)) over voiced frames; spectral centroid = centroid of the 0–10 kHz amplitude spectrum averaged over active frames; nonlinear phenomena are represented by a proxy: subharmonic frames (a comparable autocorrelation peak at half or a third of the chosen period) plus aperiodic frames inside phonation, as a share of active frames. This proxy is not the %NLP that Raine et al. annotated by hand from spectrograms, and the two cannot be compared directly. The pitch tracker mistakes some breath noise ringing narrow-band in a formant for a very high F0; corpus and synthesizer are affected alike."
 },
 "analysisOptions": {
  "f0FloorHz": 100,
  "f0CeilingHz": 2200,
  "frameS": 0.04,
  "hopS": 0.01,
  "voicingThreshold": 0.45,
  "octaveCost": 0.04,
  "activeDb": -25,
  "voicedDb": -20,
  "subMargin": 0.1,
  "subRise": 0.03,
  "repeatRatio": 0.85,
  "aperiodicR": 0.6,
  "centroidMaxHz": 10000
 },
 "intensityMapping": {
  "assumption": {
   "zh": "语料的强度等级与本项目 0–10 刻度的对应是假设，不是测量。VIVAE 的四级等距放在 2.5、5、7.5、10；Raine 等的三级按给演员的情境描述放在 3、6.5、10。两个语料都是按指令表演出来的发声，不是真实疼痛时的录音。",
   "en": "The correspondence between corpus intensity levels and this project's 0–10 scale is an assumption, not a measurement. VIVAE's four levels are placed evenly at 2.5, 5, 7.5 and 10; the three levels of Raine et al. are placed by the scenarios given to the actors, at 3, 6.5 and 10. Both corpora consist of vocalisations acted on instruction, not recordings made during real pain."
  },
